WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.001
-Welcome, everybody, welcome to

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.168
"The Tonight Show"!

00:00:03.168 --> 00:00:05.271
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:06.605
Isn't that amazing?

00:00:06.605 --> 00:00:10.409
Well, guys, today is
Teacher Appreciation Day and...

00:00:10.409 --> 00:00:15.614
[ Cheering and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:15.614 --> 00:00:17.883
...tonight's audience is filled

00:00:17.883 --> 00:00:19.485
with New York City
school teachers.

00:00:19.485 --> 00:00:20.786
[ Cheering and applause ]
So welcome.

00:00:20.786 --> 00:00:21.854
Thank you for being here.

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:25.491
♪♪

00:00:25.491 --> 00:00:27.059
You always do incredible work,

00:00:27.059 --> 00:00:28.895
but to spend a year
teaching remotely

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:30.996
during a pandemic
is really amazing.

00:00:30.996 --> 00:00:34.267
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:36.903
You're all heroes
for kids, parents,

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:38.171
and liquor stores everywhere.

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:43.643
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:45.245
I'm so honored
that you're here.

00:00:45.245 --> 00:00:46.780
I want you to know,
right before the show,

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:49.882
I made sure none of tonight's
jokes end in a preposition.

00:00:49.882 --> 00:00:53.353
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:55.521
I know a lot of you are back
in the classroom.

00:00:55.521 --> 00:00:58.257
I'm sure it's nice to see
the kids in person again,

00:00:58.257 --> 00:01:00.026
but you can be honest --
I bet some of you are missing

00:01:00.026 --> 00:01:01.560
that sweet, sweet mute button.

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:04.164
[ Laughter and applause ]
Yeah, right?

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:06.232
We don't care
about your weekend, Candace.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:10.336
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:13.072
A lot of businesses are offering
discounts for teachers.

00:01:13.072 --> 00:01:16.542
I saw that Buffalo Wild Wings
has a special deal,

00:01:16.542 --> 00:01:18.344
but Hooters doesn't.

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:19.545
[ Laughter ]
-Oh.

00:01:19.545 --> 00:01:21.147
-Which is probably smart
because, if you thought

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:23.616
running into your teacher
at the mall was awkward...

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:25.885
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:27.219
Speaking of school, yesterday,

00:01:27.219 --> 00:01:29.822
President Biden visited
an elementary school in Virginia

00:01:29.822 --> 00:01:31.624
and he talked to some students
about their

00:01:31.624 --> 00:01:34.260
remote learning experience.
Watch this.

00:01:52.611 --> 00:01:57.616
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:57.616 --> 00:01:59.585
Biden was like, "Okay,
there's two kids

00:01:59.585 --> 00:02:00.954
who are too honest
for politics."

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:02.788
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.788 --> 00:02:04.190
Then, Biden started
telling his story

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:05.391
and the girl was like --
[ Snoring ]

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:07.827
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:10.596
After the Bidens left,
the teacher was like,

00:02:10.596 --> 00:02:13.031
"What?!

00:02:13.031 --> 00:02:14.667
What did you just do?!

00:02:14.667 --> 00:02:15.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:18.637
The president and first lady
were just here!

00:02:18.637 --> 00:02:20.039
Alright, we're going to learn
a new lesson, called

00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:23.609
Not Being a Rat!

00:02:23.609 --> 00:02:25.612
They're never coming back
to the school!"

00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:26.946
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.946 --> 00:02:28.380
Meanwhile, everyone is
talking about this.

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:32.018
The Jimmy Carter Library
just released this photo

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:34.554
of the Bidens visiting
the Carters last week.

00:02:34.554 --> 00:02:35.688
Have you heard of this?

00:02:35.688 --> 00:02:37.089
Take a look.
See if you see anything odd

00:02:37.089 --> 00:02:38.157
with this photograph.

00:02:38.157 --> 00:02:44.664
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:47.466
That looks like a second grader
made a presidential diorama.

00:02:47.466 --> 00:02:50.570
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:51.871
Can we see that photo again?

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:54.140
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:56.241
They look like
Jeff Dunham's retired puppets.

00:02:56.241 --> 00:03:00.713
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:03.749 --> 00:03:06.118
I learned two things
from the photo --

00:03:06.118 --> 00:03:08.187
the two families are very close

00:03:08.187 --> 00:03:10.622
and Biden is the size
of Jason Momoa.

00:03:10.622 --> 00:03:12.224
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:12.224 --> 00:03:14.160
That must've been a fun day
for the Bidens and Carters.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.295
Look at the photo
they released next.

00:03:16.295 --> 00:03:17.763
-♪ Nants ♪
-Amazing.

00:03:17.763 --> 00:03:18.998
[ Laughter and applause ]
-♪ Ingonyama ♪

00:03:18.998 --> 00:03:20.232
♪ Bagithi baba ♪

00:03:20.232 --> 00:03:21.601
♪ Sithi uhm ♪

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:24.536
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.536 --> 00:03:25.871
-Yep, Biden is busy today.

00:03:25.871 --> 00:03:27.706
He gave an update
on the vaccine rollout,

00:03:27.706 --> 00:03:28.974
but he struggled a bit

00:03:28.974 --> 00:03:30.977
with the name of the website.
Listen to this.

00:03:38.984 --> 00:03:43.823
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:43.823 --> 00:03:45.491
-Yeah.

00:03:45.491 --> 00:03:47.593
That should make it easier.

00:03:47.593 --> 00:03:48.995
[ As Biden ]
Again, the website is

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:52.732
WrigleyWrigleyWrigley.
vaccines.gum.

00:03:52.732 --> 00:03:56.202
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.202 --> 00:03:57.436
The White House is like,
"Damn it,

00:03:57.436 --> 00:04:00.072
somebody buy vaccines.gum,
right now, stat!

00:04:00.072 --> 00:04:01.307
[ Laughter ]
Buy it, just to have it!

00:04:01.307 --> 00:04:02.909
Everyone's going to --"

00:04:02.909 --> 00:04:04.777
[ As Biden ]
Vaccines.gum.

00:04:04.777 --> 00:04:06.378
[ Laughter ]

00:04:06.378 --> 00:04:07.947
Yep, it's either
Pfizer, Moderna,

00:04:07.947 --> 00:04:09.982
or Bubblicious.
That's your choices.

00:04:09.982 --> 00:04:12.151
[ Laughter ]

00:04:12.151 --> 00:04:14.587
[ As Biden ]
Make it easier for everybody.

00:04:14.587 --> 00:04:17.924
Go to vaccine.gum, .gov, .com.

00:04:17.924 --> 00:04:19.859
[ Laughter ]

00:04:19.859 --> 00:04:21.727
Here's some great news --
next week,

00:04:21.727 --> 00:04:23.896
the FDA is set
to approve the Pfizer shot

00:04:23.896 --> 00:04:26.965
for kids between the ages
of 12 and 15.

00:04:26.965 --> 00:04:31.938
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:04:31.938 --> 00:04:33.272
Parents were like, "Good,
because, either way,

00:04:33.272 --> 00:04:34.306
they were going to summer camp."

00:04:34.306 --> 00:04:37.710
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:39.412
Meanwhile,
Governor Phil Murphy announced

00:04:39.412 --> 00:04:41.414
that New Jersey
is offering free beer

00:04:41.414 --> 00:04:43.816
to residents who get vaccinated
through its new

00:04:43.816 --> 00:04:45.651
Shot and a Beer program.

00:04:45.651 --> 00:04:47.686
[ Oohs and applause ]

00:04:47.686 --> 00:04:49.622
Which is why every 15-year-old

00:04:49.622 --> 00:04:51.958
just said they want to get
vaccinated in New Jersey.

00:04:51.958 --> 00:04:53.292
[ Laughter ]

00:04:53.292 --> 00:04:55.495
Right now, some guy in Jersey's
enjoying a free beer

00:04:55.495 --> 00:04:57.196
at a Bada Bing, thinking --

00:04:57.196 --> 00:04:59.065
[ Italian accent ]
Not all heroes wear capes.

00:04:59.065 --> 00:05:02.234
[ Laughter ]

00:05:02.234 --> 00:05:03.602
Ah!

00:05:03.602 --> 00:05:05.872
Some more COVID news --
I read that Washington, D.C.

00:05:05.872 --> 00:05:08.140
just unveiled
new social distancing rules

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:10.543
that ban dancing at weddings.

00:05:10.543 --> 00:05:11.744
[ Grumbling ]

00:05:11.744 --> 00:05:13.913
So, if you planned
a big choreographed dance,

00:05:13.913 --> 00:05:16.315
the mayor just did you
a huge favor.

00:05:16.315 --> 00:05:20.286
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:20.286 --> 00:05:21.354
If you're keeping track,

00:05:21.354 --> 00:05:22.855
we have an old guy
as our president,

00:05:22.855 --> 00:05:24.289
tensions with North Korea,

00:05:24.289 --> 00:05:25.724
and we've banned dancing.

00:05:25.724 --> 00:05:28.794
This is going to be the best
summer of 1952, ever!

00:05:28.794 --> 00:05:33.099
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:05:33.099 --> 00:05:35.768
Well, guys, not only is it
Teacher Appreciation Day,

00:05:35.768 --> 00:05:37.603
but it's also Star Wars Day.

00:05:37.603 --> 00:05:39.805
[ Cheering and applause ]
That's right.

00:05:39.805 --> 00:05:41.941
Today is May the Fourth,

00:05:41.941 --> 00:05:44.744
and that means news anchors
around the country decided

00:05:44.744 --> 00:05:47.412
to try their best
Yoda impression.

00:05:47.412 --> 00:05:48.714
Here are some of our favorites.

00:05:48.714 --> 00:05:50.183
-[ As Yoda ] Do or do not.

00:05:50.183 --> 00:05:51.784
There is no try.

00:05:51.784 --> 00:05:53.052
-[ As Yoda ] Do or not do.

00:05:53.052 --> 00:05:54.386
There is no try.

00:05:54.386 --> 00:05:56.522
-[ As Yoda ] Do or do not.
-[ As Yoda ] Do or do not.

00:05:56.522 --> 00:05:57.523
-[ As Yoda ]
There is no try.

00:05:57.523 --> 00:05:59.258
-[ As Yoda ] Do or do not.

00:05:59.258 --> 00:06:00.693
Because there is no try.

00:06:00.693 --> 00:06:01.727
-[ Robotically ]
Do or do not.

00:06:01.727 --> 00:06:03.195
There is no try?

00:06:03.195 --> 00:06:10.236
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:10.236 --> 00:06:12.371
-Come on.
-You actually did

00:06:12.371 --> 00:06:14.573
and didn't try,
at the same time.

00:06:14.573 --> 00:06:16.141
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:16.141 --> 00:06:18.110
[ Robotically ]
Do or do not, to that is try?

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:20.046
[ Laughter ]

00:06:20.046 --> 00:06:21.747
Well, here's another story
everyone's talking about.

00:06:21.747 --> 00:06:25.250
After 27 years of marriage,
Bill and Melinda Gates

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:26.952
just announced
that they're splitting up.

00:06:26.952 --> 00:06:28.220
[ Awws ]

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:29.988
You know,
Melinda Gates is thinking,

00:06:29.988 --> 00:06:31.556
"Finally, I can use a MacBook!"

00:06:31.556 --> 00:06:34.827
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:34.827 --> 00:06:36.462
I think they both
deserve their privacy,

00:06:36.462 --> 00:06:39.432
but, if ABC wants to make Bill
the next Bachelor, I'm all in.

00:06:39.432 --> 00:06:40.833
[ Laughter ]

00:06:40.833 --> 00:06:42.267
We're wishing them the best.

00:06:42.267 --> 00:06:44.736
Remember what they say --
"When God closes a door..."

00:06:44.736 --> 00:06:46.439
He opens a Windows 95.

00:06:46.439 --> 00:06:50.342
[ Laughter ]

00:06:50.342 --> 00:06:52.111
Finally,
I saw that American Girl

00:06:52.111 --> 00:06:54.279
is bringing back
its six original dolls

00:06:54.279 --> 00:06:57.116
to celebrate
its 35th anniversary.

00:06:57.116 --> 00:06:58.650
[ Applause ]
Yeah. And this is nice --

00:06:58.650 --> 00:07:00.986
after the news yesterday,
they're adding two new dolls.

00:07:00.986 --> 00:07:02.187
That's very interesting.

00:07:02.187 --> 00:07:04.190
[ Cheering and applause ]
We have a great show.

